WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:05.880
What is a protein? We often think about
protein as a nutritional requirement.

2
00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:10.690
You eat meat because it has a lot of
protein. But proteins are far more than

3
00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:15.220
just food. Proteins are made of a
string of smaller building blocks,

4
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:20.620
called amino acids. Amino acids, are
kind of like Legos that can be used to

5
00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:25.010
build proteins with different
structures. When we eat our food, we

6
00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:29.690
break down the proteins that we ate
into amino acids, and then we stick

7
00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:33.260
them back together again to make lots
of different types of proteins to do

8
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.510
jobs in the cell. Here are some things
that proteins come do: detect light,

9
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:46.310
form hair and fight disease. Let's look
more closely at three examples. One,

10
00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:51.550
proteins move you. The reason that meat
has a lot of protein is that meat is

11
00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:56.540
muscle. Muscle has to contract to move
our body, so it's full of a type of

12
00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:01.580
protein that moves stuff around. Let's
see how that works. Here are some

13
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:06.370
proteins in the muscle fiber. This
protein, called myosin can change its

14
00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:10.950
shape. When it changes shape, it moves
these fibers relative to one another.

15
00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:15.160
Millions of these tiny movements cause
the whole muscle to contract.

16
00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:22.710
Two, proteins can kill you. Bo-Tox is a
protein that cuts up molecules in nerve

17
00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:27.130
cells that control your muscles. This
means that Bo-Tox makes your muscles

18
00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:32.510
relax. This could be handy to reduce
wrinkles for Hollywood actors, but it's

19
00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:35.860
not so great when the muscles
controlling your lungs stop working

20
00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:41.770
after you eat food contaminated with
botulism. Three, proteins speed things

21
00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:47.700
up. Enzymes are proteins that make
reactions go more quickly. For example,

22
00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:53.770
the enzyme, amylase, helps break down
starch into sugar. You have amylase in

23
00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:59.130
your saliva. Try chewing a piece of
bread for a really long time. Keep

24
00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.370
chewing. What do you notice?

